# Test your FastAPI Video Player Backend
# Run with: uvicorn src.main:app --reload
# Base URL: http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Root Endpoint
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

# ============================================================================
# HEALTH CHECKS
# ============================================================================

### Health Check (comprehensive)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Liveness Probe
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

### Readiness Probe
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

# ============================================================================
# AUTHENTICATION
# ============================================================================

### Register New User
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

###

### Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=testuser&password=testpass123

###

# ============================================================================
# VIDEO MANAGEMENT (requires authentication)
# ============================================================================

### Upload Video (replace with actual video file path)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/videos/
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlciIsImV4cCI6MTc2Mjc5NTg5OH0.-qPjWmp0HhdnElYkwX2ZCur4DO59gMHT3MfHfa37PWQ
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./sample.mp4
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

My Sample Video
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###

### List User's Videos
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/videos/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

###

### List Videos with Pagination
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/videos/?skip=0&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Specific Video
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/videos/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete Video
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/videos/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###

# ============================================================================
# VIDEO STREAMING (requires authentication)
# ============================================================================

### Get HLS Playlist
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/stream/1/playlist.m3u8
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/vnd.apple.mpegurl

###

### Get HLS Segment (example segment)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/stream/1/segment00001.ts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: video/MP2T

###

# ============================================================================
# ERROR TESTING
# ============================================================================

### Unauthorized Access (no token)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/videos/
Accept: application/json

###

### Invalid Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=wronguser&password=wrongpass

###

### Access Non-existent Video
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/videos/999
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

###

### Upload Invalid File Type
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/videos/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notavideo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not a video file
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Invalid File
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###
